{"status":"success","message":null,"data":{"responsibilities":null,"overview":null,"locations":"Bangalore","processCompleted":false,"deleted":false,"mailPublished":true,"newCompany":false,"dream":false,"notificationMuted":true,"applied":false,"studentOopsOrFrozen":false,"modifyAllowed":false,"withdrawAllowed":false,"withdrawalDeadlineSameAsApplicationDeadline":false,"displayNameSameAsCompanyName":true,"includedInApplicationMatrix":false,"application_detail_id":6356,"application_id":1297,"application_status_id":3,"placement_process_id":44,"batch_group_id":0,"batch_group_ids":"[59, 60]","dayslot_id":0,"cluster_id":0,"cluster_sequence_number":0,"job_function_id":0,"uuid":"9c6591ec-de27-4fb5-86ac-3fd211f7cb28","sector_id":48,"company_id":1759,"max_roles_to_be_applied":1,"company_name":"Relecura","job_title":"Applied Scientist (AI)","sector_label":"Internet and E-commerce","other_sector":"","max_roles":0,"job_summary":"","job_function":"","job_description":"","process_name":"FT 2025-26","batch_group_label":"","skills":"Hands-on experience with Large Language Models, prompt engineering, and fine-tuning for domain-specific tasks.\nProficiency in Python and its ecosystem (FastAPI, LangChain).\nInformation Retrieval principles, vector databases, hybrid search, RAG and ranking algorithms\n[Optional] Experience with Java for building scalable backend services, familiarity and experience with AWS.","website_url":"https://relecura.ai/","eligibility_information":"1–2 years of full-time software engineering experience (prior to your Master's degree). We value candidates who have navigated the complexities of a production environment.\n","job_package":"","min_work_experience":12,"max_work_experience":0,"is_dream":false,"date_of_visit":null,"publish_time":1778740506000,"withdrawl_deadline":1779017400000,"application_deadline":1779017400000,"application_start_time":1778742000000,"additional_information":"<div>Relecura provides AI tools for intellectual property professionals (like patent attorneys). We are building a full-vertical AI platform for a multi billion-dollar industry and are funded by a strategic global leader in the IP space. Our customers include Fortune 500 companies, Research Labs, AmLaw 100 and Legal EMEA 500 firms. We need a builder&#8212;someone who can use LLMs to address complex IP use cases like patentability search, automated claim drafting, office action responses, and patent landscape generation. You will be getting onboard a rocketship. Building vertical AI solutions at massive scale for a ready base of enterprise customers is a rare and unique opportunity in the Indian ecosystem.&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>As an Applied Scientist, you will own the end-to-end lifecycle of features that will be used by patent attorneys and corporate IP departments worldwide.&#160;You will:&#160;</div><div>- Design and implement LLM-based workflows for technical drafting and legal reasoning.</div><div>- Fine tune LLMs for the nuances of patent law to ensure AI meet the high standards of legal accuracy.</div><div>- Build and optimize AI based search and information retrieval for patents.<br>- Write production-grade code to be deployed on our cloud infrastructure.</div><div><br></div><div>Why Join Relecura?<br>Ownership: You will own core product verticals. Your solutions will reach real customers within weeks, not months or years. This is important in the AI world.<br>Trajectory: We are at the inflection point of growth, backed by the strategic investments that provide us both capital and immediate market access.<br>High Stakes, High Reward: We offer attractive stock options (ESOPs), ensuring you are a true partner in Relecura's long-term success.</div>","additional_details":null,"is_notification_muted":true,"is_withdrawal_same_as_application_deadline":false,"is_new_company":false,"is_display_name_same_as_company_name":true,"is_included_in_application_matrix":false,"display_name":"Relecura","is_published":true,"is_deleted":false,"is_pr